    "The number this summit is built on": "本届峰会的核心数据",
    "Kenya exported 652.8 million kilogrammes of tea in 2025, worth\n          KES 186.91 billion. China bought 13,011 tonnes of it, around two per\n          cent.": "2025年,肯尼亚出口了652.8百万公斤茶叶,价值186.91十亿肯尼亚先令。中国购买了13,011吨,约占2%。",
    "China is the largest tea market in the world. Pakistan alone takes 36\n          per cent of Kenya's exports. The opportunity sits in the distance\n          between those two figures.": "中国是全球最大的茶叶市场。仅巴基斯坦就占肯尼亚出口量的36%。这两个数字之间的差距正是机遇所在。",
    "This summit puts both sides in the same room for three days.": "本届峰会让双方在同一会场相聚三天。",
    "Source: <a href=\"https://www.teaboard.or.ke/images/downloads/performance-highlights/TEA-INDUSTRY-PERFORMANCE-REPORT-2025.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Tea Board of Kenya, Tea Industry Performance Report 2025</a>. China import figure for 2024, <a href=\"https://www.ecofinagency.com/news-agriculture/1302-52890-kenya-tea-exports-rise-in-2025-revenue-slips-on-lower-prices\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Ecofin Agency</a>.": "数据来源:<a href=\"https://www.teaboard.or.ke/images/downloads/performance-highlights/TEA-INDUSTRY-PERFORMANCE-REPORT-2025.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">肯尼亚茶叶委员会,2025年茶叶行业绩效报告</a>。中国进口数据为2024年,<a href=\"https://www.ecofinagency.com/news-agriculture/1302-52890-kenya-tea-exports-rise-in-2025-revenue-slips-on-lower-prices\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Ecofin Agency</a>。",
