    "Opening ceremony and Trade Forum": "开幕式和贸易论坛",
    "A practical look at the Kenya-China tea market: demand, product fit, standards, routes to market and the relationships needed to grow trade.": "从实践角度探讨肯尼亚-中国茶叶市场:需求、产品契合度、标准、市场渠道以及促进贸易增长所需的合作关系。",
    "Investment Forum, Innovation Conference and B2B Matchmaking": "投资论坛、创新大会及B2B配对会",
    "Financing, equipment, technology and structured meetings between relevant buyers, suppliers and partners.": "融资、设备、技术以及买家、供应商和合作伙伴之间的结构化会议。",
    "International Tea &amp; Technology Expo, Cultural Exchange and Closing Ceremony": "国际茶叶及科技博览会、文化交流及闭幕式",
    "Tea products, processing solutions, agricultural technologies and logistics services, alongside cultural programming and the summit close.": "茶叶产品、加工解决方案、农业技术和物流服务,以及文化活动和峰会闭幕。",
    "<a href=\"/programme/\">View the programme</a>": "<a href=\"/programme/\">查看日程</a>",
    "The International Tea &amp; Technology Expo": "国际茶叶及科技博览会",
    "146 stands across two halls, in a tent on the KICC grounds. Tea products, processing equipment, agricultural technology and logistics services. The expo runs on Day 3, with the full delegation on site.": "在KICC场地的帐篷内设有两个展厅共146个展位。展示茶叶产品、加工设备、农业技术和物流服务。博览会在第3天举行,届时全体代表团将在场。",
    "Stand rates and sizes: <span class=\"value--pending\">to be announced</span>.": "展位价格和规格:<span class=\"value--pending\">待公布</span>。",
