    "<p class=\"news-card__date\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-23\">23 August 2026</time></p>\n        <h3><a href=\"/news/what-chinese-buyers-look-for/\">What Chinese buyers look for in African tea</a></h3>\n        <p>For exporters weighing whether the Chinese market is worth the effort.</p>": "<p class=\"news-card__date\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-23\">2026年8月23日</time></p>\n        <h3><a href=\"/news/what-chinese-buyers-look-for/\">中国买家在非洲茶叶中寻找什么</a></h3>\n        <p>为权衡中国市场是否值得努力的出口商提供参考。</p>",
